---
// F4 step sequence on a warm band. The nav's "Method" link targets #how.
// (Hum redesign 2026-07.)
---
<section class="section section--band how" id="how" aria-labelledby="how-title">
  <div class="band-inner">
    <h2 id="how-title">How a session works</h2>
    <p class="how__lede">
      Shadowing means speaking in real time alongside a native speaker, the
      training method conference interpreters use to make a second language automatic.
    </p>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li>
        <span class="n" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
        <h3>Choose your content</h3>
        <p>Pick a curated episode matched to your level, or import your own Spanish content from TikTok, Instagram, or any video file.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="n" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
        <h3>Listen and analyze</h3>
        <p>Play through the audio with the full transcript visible. Get familiar with the speaker's pace, rhythm, and pronunciation.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="n" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
        <h3>Shadow out loud</h3>
        <p>Speak simultaneously with the native speaker. Follow the highlighted text to stay in sync, and repeat any sentence until it feels natural.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="n" aria-hidden="true">04</span>
        <h3>Progress to blind shadowing</h3>
        <p>Practice without the text. Your brain processes and produces Spanish purely by ear. This is the stage that builds true automaticity.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>
